<https://lovamap.com/ontology#paper/10.1002-adhm.202101867> a bibo:AcademicArticle ;
    rdfs:label "Kurt & Segura, 2021 — Nucleic Acid Delivery from Granular Hydrogels" ;
    dc:title "Nucleic Acid Delivery from Granular Hydrogels" ;
    dc:identifier "10.1002/adhm.202101867" ;
    dc:date "2021"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dc:type "Research Article" ;
    schema:isPartOf <https://lovamap.com/ontology#journal/advanced-healthcare-materials> ;
    dc:creator <https://lovamap.com/ontology#author/kurt-evan> , <https://lovamap.com/ontology#author/segura-tatiana> ;
    bibo:authorList ( <https://lovamap.com/ontology#author/kurt-evan> <https://lovamap.com/ontology#author/segura-tatiana> ) ;
    dc:bibliographicCitation "Kurt & Segura, 2021" ;
    lova:focusMaterial "DNA/PEI polyplexes coated with hyaluronic acid (unmodified, acrylamide, or norbornene-modified), lyophilized and loaded into shredded hydrogel microparticles (sHMP) annealed into Flowable Linked Irregular Particle (FLIP) granular hydrogel scaffolds for sustained nucleic acid delivery" .

